## Инструменты (Tools)

### Создание

```bash
php artisan make:tool RandomNumberGenerator
```

```php
<?php

namespace App\Ai\Tools;

use Illuminate\Contracts\JsonSchema\JsonSchema;
use Laravel\Ai\Contracts\Tool;
use Laravel\Ai\Tools\Request;
use Stringable;

class RandomNumberGenerator implements Tool
{
    public function description(): Stringable|string
    {
        return 'Generates cryptographically secure random numbers.';
    }

    public function handle(Request $request): Stringable|string
    {
        return (string) random_int($request['min'], $request['max']);
    }

    public function schema(JsonSchema $schema): array
    {
        return [
            'min' => $schema->integer()->min(0)->required(),
            'max' => $schema->integer()->required(),
        ];
    }
}
```

Добавить в агент:
```php
public function tools(): iterable
{
    return [new RandomNumberGenerator];
}
```

### Similarity Search (RAG)

```php
use App\Models\Document;
use Laravel\Ai\Tools\SimilaritySearch;

// Простой вариант
SimilaritySearch::usingModel(Document::class, 'embedding'),

// С фильтрами
SimilaritySearch::usingModel(
    model: Document::class,
    column: 'embedding',
    minSimilarity: 0.7,
    limit: 10,
    query: fn ($q) => $q->where('published', true),
)->withDescription('Search the knowledge base.'),

// Кастомная логика
new SimilaritySearch(using: function (string $query) {
    return Document::query()
        ->where('user_id', $this->user->id)
        ->whereVectorSimilarTo('embedding', $query)
        ->limit(10)->get();
}),
```

### Provider Tools

```php
use Laravel\Ai\Providers\Tools\FileSearch;
use Laravel\Ai\Providers\Tools\WebFetch;
use Laravel\Ai\Providers\Tools\WebSearch;

public function tools(): iterable
{
    return [
        // Web Search (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini)
        (new WebSearch)->max(5)->allow(['laravel.com', 'php.net']),
        (new WebSearch)->location(city: 'Moscow', region: 'MOW', country: 'RU'),

        // Web Fetch (Anthropic, Gemini)
        (new WebFetch)->max(3)->allow(['docs.laravel.com']),

        // File Search (OpenAI, Gemini)
        new FileSearch(stores: ['store_id_1', 'store_id_2']),
        // С фильтрацией по metadata
        new FileSearch(stores: ['store_id'], where: ['author' => 'Taylor Otwell', 'year' => 2026]),
        // Сложные фильтры
        new FileSearch(stores: ['store_id'], where: fn (FileSearchQuery $q) =>
            $q->where('author', 'Taylor Otwell')
              ->whereNot('status', 'draft')
              ->whereIn('category', ['news', 'updates'])
        ),
    ];
}
```

