## Эмбеддинги (Embeddings)

```php
use Illuminate\Support\Str;
use Laravel\Ai\Embeddings;

// Через Stringable
$embeddings = Str::of('Napa Valley has great wine.')->toEmbeddings();
$embeddings = Str::of('Napa Valley.')->toEmbeddings(cache: true);   // с кешем
$embeddings = Str::of('Napa Valley.')->toEmbeddings(cache: 3600);   // кеш 1 час

// Для нескольких строк
$response = Embeddings::for([
    'Napa Valley has great wine.',
    'Laravel is a PHP framework.',
])->dimensions(1536)->generate(Lab::OpenAI, 'text-embedding-3-small');

$response->embeddings; // [[0.123, ...], [0.789, ...]]

// С кешем
$response = Embeddings::for(['...'])->cache(seconds: 3600)->generate();
```

### Vector-колонки (pgvector)

```php
// Миграция
Schema::ensureVectorExtensionExists();
Schema::create('documents', function (Blueprint $table) {
    $table->id();
    $table->text('content');
    $table->vector('embedding', dimensions: 1536)->index(); // HNSW cosine index
    $table->timestamps();
});

// Модель
protected function casts(): array { return ['embedding' => 'array']; }

// Запросы
$docs = Document::query()
    ->whereVectorSimilarTo('embedding', 'best wineries in Napa', minSimilarity: 0.4)
    ->limit(10)->get();

// Ручной контроль
$docs = Document::query()
    ->select('*')
    ->selectVectorDistance('embedding', $queryEmbedding, as: 'distance')
    ->whereVectorDistanceLessThan('embedding', $queryEmbedding, maxDistance: 0.3)
    ->orderByVectorDistance('embedding', $queryEmbedding)
    ->limit(10)->get();
```

