Reranking::fake([[
    new RankedDocument(index: 0, document: 'First', score: 0.95),
    new RankedDocument(index: 1, document: 'Second', score: 0.80),
]]);
Reranking::assertReranked(fn ($p) => $p->contains('Laravel'));
```

### Файлы

```php
use Laravel\Ai\Files;
use Laravel\Ai\Contracts\Files\StorableFile;
use Laravel\Ai\Files\Document;

Files::fake();

Document::fromString('Hello!', mimeType: 'text/plain')->as('hello.txt')->put();

Files::assertStored(fn (StorableFile $f) => (string) $f === 'Hello!');
Files::assertNothingStored();
Files::assertDeleted('file-id');
Files::assertNothingDeleted();
```

### Векторные хранилища

```php
use Laravel\Ai\Stores;
use Laravel\Ai\Contracts\Files\StorableFile;

Stores::fake(); // автоматически фейкает Files

$store = Stores::get('store_id');
$store->add('added_id');
$store->remove('removed_id');

Stores::assertCreated('Knowledge Base');
$store->assertAdded('added_id');
$store->assertRemoved('removed_id');

// Когда file ID неизвестен
$store->add(Document::fromString('Hello!', 'text/plain')->as('hello.txt'));
$store->assertAdded(fn (StorableFile $f) => $f->name() === 'hello.txt');
```

